nt><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiAwayNotificationClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Properties><Property><Name>conditionalshow</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>AddControlBlockNotificationToContainer</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Add new control block as control-block-notification to data-set directory (control-block-notification list). Control-block will be notified on data-set-member data update/change. ]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>ipControlBlock</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Control block to be added to the data-set directory ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiCommonControlBlockClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>bMatched</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ TRUE => notification link is already existing, FALSE => new notification link added ]]></Comment><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Parameter><Name>ipDirNode</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Corresponding data-set directory node (class: ControlBlockNotification) ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiControlBlockNotificationClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Properties><Property><Name>conditionalshow</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>AddMember</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Add new data-set-member to data-set directory (member list) ]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>ipData</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Data/attribute to be added as data-set-member ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiCommonDataClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>eFc</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Data's functional constraint ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_