ataSetDirectory</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Deletes all by class specified objects from data-set directory ]]></Comment><Parameter><Name>eClass</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Directory class to be deleted (Member, ControlBlockNotification,...) ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">E_AcsiDataSetDirectoryClass</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>nDeleted</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Number of successfully deleted objects ]]></Comment><Type>UDINT</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Properties><Property><Name>conditionalshow</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>DeleteMember</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Delete data-set-member from data-set-directory ]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>ipData</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Data/attribute to be deleted from data-set directory ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiCommonDataClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>eFc</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Functional constraint of data/attribute to be deleted from data-set directory ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">E_AcsiFc</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>GetDataSetDirectory</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Get data-set's directory (list of data set members or control-block-notifications)]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>eClass</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Data-set directory class to be get (Member, ControlBlockNotification) ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">E_AcsiDataSetDirectoryClass</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>ipMembers</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Get data-set directory (class: Member) ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiDataSetMemberClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Parameter><Name>ipControlBlockNotifications</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Get data-set directory (class: ControlBlockNotification) ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiControlBlockNotificationClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Parameter><Name>ipAwayNotifications</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Get data-set directory (class: DeleteNotification) ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiAwayNotificationClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Properties><Property><Name>conditionalshow</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>GetFirstDataSetMember</Name><ReturnType Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiDataSetMemberClass</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>64</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>ipData</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiCommonDataClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Parameter><Name>eFc</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">E_AcsiFc</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Properties><Property><Name>conditionalshow</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>GetMember</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Get data-set-member directory node by member data and fc ]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>ipData</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Data-set-member data/attribute value ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiCommonDataClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>eFc</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Data-set-member functional constraints value ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">E_AcsiFc</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>ipDirNode</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Get data-set-member directory node ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiDataSetMemberClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Properties><Property><Name>conditionalshow</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>GetParentAA</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ This method checks and returns data-set's parent aa-node (application-association data node).
	Only non-persistent data-sets are attached to parent aa-node.
	For persistent data-sets, attached to logical-node this method will fail (return value FALSE and null ipAaNode output value). ]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>ipAaNode</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Parent aa-node (data-set's parent) ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiCommonAaNodeClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter><Properties><Property><Name>conditionalshow</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>GetParentLN</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ 	This method checks and returns interface pointer to data-set's logical node parent (container) object.
	Default container for data-set's are "LLN0" logical nodes. 
	Return value: 
	TRUE => Success, data-set is attached to parent logical node container and returned ipLogicalNode interface pointer is valid. 
	FALSE => Failed, data-set is not attached to parent logical node container and returned ipLogicalNode interface pointer is not valid (0). ]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>ipLogicalNode</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Interface pointer to logical node parent (container). ]]></Comment><Type Namespace="Tc3_Acsi">I_AcsiCommonLogicalNodeClass</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>GetParentLNDirectory</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ 	This method returns interfase pointer to parents logical node directory. The returned directory contains list of object references belonging to specified class. 
	Return value:
	TRUE => Success, ipDirectory interface pointer is valid.
