This method modifies also the size of internal target (decoding) or source (encoding) memory buffer too.
ReSize(iSize:=0) means unknown size and sets the internal memory buffer size to the max. supported size (max. octet-string size to be encoded/decoded).
If you set ReSize(0) and then decode then new iSize value will be determined and set on the basis of the decoded MMS data.
If you set ReSize(0) and then encode then integer of max. supported size will be encoded as MMS data ]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>iSize</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Number of octet-string octets: positive (absolute) number => fixed length, negative number => variable length ]]></Comment><Type>DINT (-64..64)</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Parameter></Method></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Tc3_Mms">I_MmsAddress</Name><BitSize>64</BitSize><ExtendsType Namespace="Tc3_Collections">I_DynamicMemoryObject</ExtendsType><Method><Name>__getipNumericAddress</Name><ReturnType Namespace="Tc3_Mms">I_MmsUnsigned32</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>64</ReturnBitSize><Properties><Property><Name>property</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>__getipSymbolicAddress</Name><ReturnType Namespace="Tc3_Mms">I_MmsString</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>64</ReturnBitSize><Properties><Property><Name>property</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>__getipUnconstrainedAddress</Name><ReturnType Namespace="Tc3_Mms">I_MmsOctetString</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>64</ReturnBitSize><Properties><Property><Name>property</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>Choice_numericAddress</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>nAddress</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_Mms">T_MmsUnsigned32</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>Choice_symbolicAddress</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>sAddress</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_Mms">T_MmsString</Type><BitSize>4096</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>Choice_unconstrainedAddress</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>ipAddress</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_Mms">I_MmsOctetString</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>CopyFrom</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><N